Implementation Plan - Mouvement Dossier & Administration Opération Dossier
This document outlines the implementation plan for adding the Mouvement Dossier module (list, search with multicriteria & pagination, movement creation with operation constraints, declaration workflow) and the Operation Dossier Administration module (interactive grid, drag-and-drop status/phase assignments, multi-select deletion, and operation reordering).

