[NEW] Services & Controllers
MvtDossierService.java & MvtDossierController.java:
GET /api/mouvements-dossier: Paginated search with multicriteria filtering (client CP, numero dossier, date min/max default to today, phase, statut, type production, agence).
GET /api/mouvements-dossier/operations-by-dossier/{dossierId}: Retrieves sequence of operations for the dossier's type production, showing completion status, dates, attached files, and constraint status (mandatory preceding operations check).
POST /api/mouvements-dossier: Executes movement for an operation. Enforces mandatory preceding operation validation, updates dossier phase & statut, uploads file if attached.
DeclarationService.java & DeclarationController.java:
POST /api/declarations: Creates a customs declaration for a dossier, attaching document if uploaded.
GET /api/declarations/dossier/{dossierId}: Fetches declaration for a dossier.
